{"title":"clash verge 配置教程 小白专用（v2.4.3+v2.4.4）","uid":"a894a10054680fda5d117c21006dfe29","slug":"Clash-Verge链式代理配置教程","date":"2026-11-24T08:06:00.000Z","updated":"2026-11-24T08:17:36.162Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/Clash-Verge链式代理配置教程.json","keywords":"VUE、Python、JAVA","cover":"/medias/clash-verge.jpg","content":"<p><strong>前提准备！！：能上外网的梯子节点+我们的节点  ！！！</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"#v2-4-3\"><strong>v2.4.3直接点这里</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#v2-4-4\"><strong>v2.4.4直接点这里</strong></a></p>\n<h2 id=\"v2-4-3\"><a href=\"#v2-4-3\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"v2.4.3\"></a>v2.4.3</h2><p>Clash Verge可视化页面配置relay分组从而实现链式代理</p>\n<p>👇👇</p>\n<p><strong>1.打开clash verge</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-1.png\" alt=\"img-1\"></p>\n<p><strong>2、点击订阅（这里有两种情况 请选择     <a href=\"#A\">A.没有代理组</a>     <a href=\"#B\">B.已有代理组</a>）</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"A\"><a href=\"#A\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"A.\"></a>A.</h3><p>↓</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-2.png\" alt=\"img-2\"></p>\n<p>点击新建— 类型选择local —名称随机填就行 —保存</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-3.png\" alt=\"img-3\"></p>\n<p>右击编辑节点</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-4.png\" alt=\"img-4\"></p>\n<p>先导入你的梯子节点</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-5.png\" alt=\"img-5\"></p>\n<p>后导入我们的节点</p>\n<p>导入的格式为<br><strong>socks5:&#x2F;&#x2F;username:password@hostname:port#备注名称</strong><br><strong>socks5:&#x2F;&#x2F;用户名:密码@主机:端口#备注名称</strong></p>\n<p>添加成功，点击保存</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-6.png\" alt=\"img-6\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"#3-%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AErelay%E5%88%86%E7%BB%84%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86\">下一步点这里</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"B\"><a href=\"#B\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"B.\"></a>B.</h3><p>↓</p>\n<p>右击编辑信息—remote改local—保存</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-7.png\" alt=\"img-7\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-8.png\" alt=\"img-8\"></p>\n<p>然后右击编辑节点 直接添加我们的ip 保存</p>\n<p>导入的格式为<br><strong>socks5:&#x2F;&#x2F;username:password@hostname:port#备注名称</strong><br><strong>socks5:&#x2F;&#x2F;用户名:密码@主机:端口#备注名称</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-9.png\" alt=\"img-9\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"3-配置relay分组实现链式代理\"><a href=\"#3-配置relay分组实现链式代理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.配置relay分组实现链式代理\"></a>3.配置relay分组实现链式代理</h3><p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-10.png\" alt=\"img-10\"></p>\n<p>这是编辑代理组默认页面</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-11.png\" alt=\"img-11\"></p>\n<p>配置relay分组<br>版本不同、汉化不同会有差异，代理组类型没有“relay”，就选择“根据定义的代理链传递”</p>\n<p>版本不同、汉化不同会有差异，代理组类型没有“relay”，就选择“<strong>根据定义的代理链传递</strong>”</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-12.png\" alt=\"img-12\"></p>\n<p>保存分组</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-13.png\" alt=\"img-13\"></p>\n<p>保存成功</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-14.png\" alt=\"img-14\"></p>\n<p><strong>4、点击代理，选择全局，随后点击刚刚配置的relay分组</strong>   链式代理001</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-15.png\" alt=\"img-15\"></p>\n<p><strong>5、虚拟网卡模式 、系统代理的按钮打开。  虚拟网络设置中选择system</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-16.png\" alt=\"img-16\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"v2-4-4\"><a href=\"#v2-4-4\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"v2.4.4\"></a>v2.4.4</h2><p>Clash Verge新版本relay 策略已经被弃用，需要使用  <a href=\"https://wiki.metacubex.one/config/proxies/#dialer-proxy\">dialer-proxy</a> 实现链式代理</p>\n<p>👇👇</p>\n<p><strong>1.安装打开clash</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-17.png\" alt=\"img-17\"></p>\n<p>点击订阅</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-18.png\" alt=\"img-18\"></p>\n<p><strong>2.右击代理组  选择编辑节点</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-19.png\" alt=\"img-19\"></p>\n<p>导入的格式为<br><strong>socks5:&#x2F;&#x2F;username:password@hostname:port#备注名称</strong><br><strong>socks5:&#x2F;&#x2F;用户名:密码@主机:端口#备注名称</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-20.png\" alt=\"img-20\"></p>\n<p>添加完成之后，点击右上角高级</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-21.png\" alt=\"img-21\"></p>\n<p>打开之后显示我们刚刚添加的IP信息</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-22.png\" alt=\"img-22\"></p>\n<p>鼠标在name那行 最后选中并回车换行  添加一行代码</p>\n<p>dialer-proxy: **dialer（这个dialer可以是任何名称）——**注意这个红色加粗的 <strong>dialer</strong> 很重要，和接下来的步骤4设置的分组名称有关。</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-23.png\" alt=\"img-23\"></p>\n<p>提示保存成功</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-24.png\" alt=\"img-24\"></p>\n<p><strong>4、设置分组</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-25.png\" alt=\"img-25\"></p>\n<p>这是默认页面</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-26.png\" alt=\"img-26\"></p>\n<p>按照截图提示配置信息</p>\n<p>特别注意   名称不可以写错     要写 <strong>dialer （对应步骤3中添加的代码）</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-27.png\" alt=\"img-27\"></p>\n<p>保存分组</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-28.png\" alt=\"img-28\"></p>\n<p>保存成功</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-29.png\" alt=\"img-29\"></p>\n<p><strong>5、点击代理，选择全局，随后点击配置好的出口IP （步骤3配置的）</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-30.png\" alt=\"img-30\"></p>\n<p><strong>6、虚拟网卡模式 、系统代理的按钮打开。  虚拟网络设置中选择system</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/post/Clash-Verge%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/img-31.png\" alt=\"img-31\"></p>\n<p><strong>7、最后浏览器打开  <a href=\"https://ipinfo.io/what-is-my-ip\">https://ipinfo.io/what-is-my-ip</a>  查看IP信息是不是你提取的节点</strong></p>\n","feature":true,"text":"前提准备！！：能上外网的梯子节点+我们的节点 ！！！ v2.4.3直接点这里 v2.4.4直接点这里 v2.4.3Clash Verge可视化页面配置relay...","permalink":"/post/Clash-Verge链式代理配置教程","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"1.3k","symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"ip","slug":"ip","count":2,"path":"api/categories/ip.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"ip","slug":"ip","count":2,"path":"api/tags/ip.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#v2-4-3\"><span class=\"toc-text\">v2.4.3</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#A\"><span class=\"toc-text\">A.</span></